<section style="padding:3rem 0;border-top:1px solid var(--color-border)"><div style="max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 1.5rem"><h2 style="font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2rem);font-weight:600;color:var(--color-text);margin-bottom:1.5rem">Why Partner with SDF Clothing?</h2><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Unlike domestic blank-apparel distributors who resell stock manufactured elsewhere, SDF Clothing cuts and sews every t-shirt to order on our own floor. That gives you control over yarn count, fabric weight, and neck-label branding that off-the-shelf blank suppliers can't offer, with pricing set at factory cost rather than distributor margin. Certification covering the facility includes GOTS, OEKO-TEX Standard 100, BSCI, WRAP, and ISO 9001.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">Most US blank t-shirt wholesalers ship same-day from warehouse stock with no minimum order — convenient, but limited to whatever fabric and fit they already hold. We require 300 pieces per style in exchange for custom fabric sourcing, private-label neck tags, and bulk pricing tiers that improve with volume, backed by local mills that already supply around 85% of Bangladesh's domestic knit fabric demand and keep lead times shorter than imported-fabric competitors.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.5rem">T-shirts sourced from Bangladesh currently avoid the Section 301 tariffs applied to Chinese-made cotton knitwear, with a 20% cap on US tariffs negotiated in late 2025 limiting further exposure. EU-bound bulk orders keep duty-free treatment under Everything But Arms through November 2029, a transition that holds even after the country's LDC graduation in November 2026 — a trade window most competing sourcing countries can't currently match. That advantage compounds with factory-direct pricing on high-volume private-label programs.</p><p style="color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:2rem">Ready to start? <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--color-primary)">Request a sample</a> or <a href="/contact" style="color:var(--color-primary)">contact our team</a> for a detailed FOB quote within 48 hours.</p></div></section>




